  "title": "Pan-Fried Salmon in Curry Cream Sauce",
  "description": "Salmon cooked in a cream sauce seasoned with mild curry powder, ginger, and lemon juice is a very easy and yummy recipe for 2. Serve with basmati rice and a salad.",
